gle most important biographical line:\n\n- Text: \"Born 19 July 1976, Hammersmith, London\"\n- Font: 14px, letter-spacing 0.18em, color: rgba(210,200,185,0.80), italic\n- A small maroon dot (•) centered above this line as separator, size 6px, color #8b2e2e\n- Dot appears at t=2.5s fade, text fades in at t=2.8s, duration 0.6s\n\n---\n\n### Block 4 — PARADOX LINE (80% from top)\n- Text: \"Theatre royalty — chosen the world's strangest hero.\"\n- Font: 16px, italic, color: rgba(240,236,228,0.60), letter-spacing 0.05em\n- Fade in at t=3.5s, duration 0.8s\n\n---\n\n## Hold & Exit\n- All elements fully visible from t=4.5s to t=8.2s\n- At t=8.2s: entire overlay fades out opacity 1→0, duration 0.7s (video bg remains)\n\n## Fonts\nLoad: https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&display=swap\n\n## Colors\n- Background overlay: rgba(8,8,12,0.62) + blur\n- Primary text: #f0ece4\n- Secondary text: rgba(200,188,172,0.75)\n- Maroon accent: #8b2e2e\n\n## CRITICAL\n- backdrop-filter blur on the overlay div covering full canvas\n- Video plays behind — faintly visible as texture\n- No audio, fully silent\n- No extra decorative elements beyond what's specified",
